{"nodes": [{"id": "_github_workflows_typecheck_dev_typecheck_dev_workflow", "label": "typecheck (dev) workflow", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".github/workflows/typecheck-dev.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Its own workflow rather than a step in test.yml because path filters are per-workflow: a step there would never fire on an examples/** or benchmarks/** change, the very changes this configuration exists to cover, and widening test.yml's filters would run the full suite on every example edit. It is also cheap enough to be a required check."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_typecheck_dev_typecheck_dev_job", "label": "typecheck-dev job", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".github/workflows/typecheck-dev.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One tsc --noEmit over tests/, examples/, benchmarks/ and src/ together. It stops the diagnostic count re-inflating: the burn-down that made this green cleared 321 diagnostics, and two of them had arrived in the days before it, from adoption sweeps that missed an example."}], "edges": [{"source": "_github_workflows_typecheck_dev_typecheck_dev_workflow", "target": "_github_workflows_typecheck_dev_typecheck_dev_job", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": ".github/workflows/typecheck-dev.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "_github_workflows_typecheck_dev_typecheck_dev_workflow", "target": "_github_workflows_test_tests_workflow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": ".github/workflows/typecheck-dev.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "_github_workflows_typecheck_dev_typecheck_dev_job", "target": "agents_typecheck_dev_gate", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "sour